    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d381">

                <pb facs="0383" n="267" sameAs="frus:frus1914/pg267"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">File No. 822.00/336.</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">Consular Agent Hedian to the Secretary of State.</hi>
                </head>
                <opener>
                    <seg rendition="#center">[Telegram.]</seg>
                </opener>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Esmeraldas</hi></placeName>, [<date
                            ana="#date_undated-inferred-from-outside-research" calendar="gregorian"
                            when="1914-02-14"><hi rendition="#italic">undated</hi></date><hi
                            rendition="#italic">; received February 10, 1914</hi>].</dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>Commander Government forces notifies Consul Esmeraldas will bombard city to-day
                    5.50. If not prevented suffering noncombatants will be horrible. No facilities
                    available to leave. Useless destruction property will cause destitution which
                    will require outside help. Warship desirable.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hedian</hi></signed>.</closer>
            </div>
        </body>
